<title>USA: Nabors Industries completes Adcor merger.</title>
<headline>Nabors Industries completes Adcor merger.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nabors Industries said Wednesday it completed a previously announced merger with Adcor-Nicklos Drilling Co.</p>
<p>Nabors said the transaction will be accounted for as a pooling-of-interest with the Adcor shareholders having received about 3.4 million shares of Nabors common stock.</p>
<p>An executive at Nabors said the acquisition of Adcor would be &quot;not only accretive to both earnings and cash flow but will further enhance Nabors' ability to service its customers and their requirements for quality rigs and crews.&quot;</p>
</text>
